## Metrics

| Name | Labels | What it means |
|---|---|---|
| `http_requests_total`, `http_error_requests_total`, `http_request_duration_seconds` | method, route, status | Every route, by route template |
| `twin_provisioning_duration_seconds` | `ready`, `failed` | From accept to `telemetry`'s answer |
| `twin_wifi_ticks_total` | `accepted`, `invalid`, `stale` | Ticks read |
| `twin_wifi_tick_lag_seconds` | | From the collector's snapshot to reading it |
| `twin_devices_published_total` | `ok`, `error`, `timeout` | Dot lists to Redis |
| `twin_occupancy_published_total` | `ok`, `error`, `timeout` | Room counts to Kafka |

